  "description": "NMB-EW-01 on the ground floor slab perimeter upstand, section. NMB Details v1.0 (2023), pp. 68-69. Datum is the finished floor level at external ground level. Upstand minimum 150 mm above ground; the facade is a continuous non-load-bearing light steel frame supported from the slab above and seated on the upstand. The DPM connects to the DPC at the top of the upstand. In the example the ground floor wall starts at the top of the upstand.",
